WEBVTT

00:17:57.246 --> 00:18:00.954
And I think it was this maybe the
first book that the material was

00:18:00.954 --> 00:18:09.454
so utterly dark and painful and true that
it was the it was the first time that

00:18:09.454 --> 00:18:13.496
I understood what war was, what grief was.

00:18:13.621 --> 00:18:15.996
You know, I'd learned about
things from a distance.

00:18:16.496 --> 00:18:20.788
And what that novel taught me is how you
can inhabit an experience that is

00:18:20.788 --> 00:18:25.288
so not your own. And and, you know,
I loved books long before that,

00:18:25.996 --> 00:18:29.163
but that was the first time I stepped
into one and thought,

00:18:29.163 --> 00:18:31.621
this is a kind of magic, if you will.